Receiver: store an upload whose closing chunk never comes. A Mac (and iPhones)
can send a whole upload without the chunked encoding's final 0 chunk; 0.14.1
then hit its 30 s idle limit and answered 408. Backported from omdrop-plugin
0.16.2/0.16.4: fec8275de1, 5e85299ba5, d8fd490672, 982c6197a6.

